### Crear usuario (POST)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Juan Perez",
  "email": "juan@example.com",
  "password": "123456",
  "role": "user"
}

###

### Obtener todos los usuarios (GET)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/users?page=1&limit=10

###

### Obtener un usuario por ID (GET)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/users/6918bcabe34298e658fdd0b0

###

### Actualizar usuario (PUT)
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/users/6918bcabe34298e658fdd0b0
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Juan Lopez",
  "role": "admin"
}

###

### Eliminar usuario (DELETE)
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/users/6918bcabe34298e658fdd0b0

